There is indeed a clear mismatch. I wrote a quick job to query each node's Raft status, and some nodes are not even moving their `commit` up. 
```
2023-08-17 01:44:18.980  [main] INFO  c.h.v.q.j.QdrantCheckConsistencyJob - Pod 0, peer 2077498272239626: RaftInfo{term=610, commit=72286, pendingOperations=0, leader=8612251857404333, role=Follower, isVoter=true}
