2023-08-17 01:44:20.300  [main] INFO  c.h.v.q.j.QdrantCheckConsistencyJob - Pod 2, peer 5752607901979511: RaftInfo{term=610, commit=79143, pendingOperations=0, leader=8612251857404333, role=Follower, isVoter=true}
