```

When trying to send over a consensus checkpoint, the following error was logged on Qdrant on pod 0 as well:
```
[2023-08-16T23:48:28.147Z INFO  raft::raft] mismatched term; dropping request snapshot, raft_id: 2077498272239626, last_term: 351, term: 610
[2023-08-16T23:48:28.147Z ERROR qdrant::consensus] Failed to propose entry: RequestSnapshotDropped
[2023-08-16T23:48:28.147Z INFO  actix_web::middleware::logger] 10.203.176.133 "POST /cluster/recover HTTP/1.1" 200 71 "-" "Horizon/0.0.1" 0.000297
```

Additional info:

```bash
for PORT in 6333 6343 6353; do   curl -s "http://localhost:${PORT}/collections/test_collection/cluster" | jq -c .; done
```

